[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "You've heard about two of the "
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "supernatural gateways in Santa Destroy."
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "The third led to the most fitting mystery "
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "of all for a city fixated on the ranks."
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "Sealed from the cacophony of modern life, "
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "there lived the last Ascetic."
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "Abstaining from all "
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "worldly indulgences,"
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "the Ascetic spent every "
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "waking hour in training."
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "Battle had become an obsession "
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "for this warrior."
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "The end-all, the raison d'etre."
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "You know, I've never "
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "abstained from anything.  "
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "Still, I can relate."
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "When you're so focused "
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "on any goal, "
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "it can make you blind,"
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "to what you truly desire."
  }
]